      },
      {
        "layer": "swc",
        "element": "ExampleConsumerSWC"
      },
      {
        "layer": "swc",
        "element": "ExampleSWC"
      }
    ],
    "notes": "A `find` reads the model and writes nothing: no scope, no baseline in the request, no audit record, no report file. The server ranks; the agent explains the evidence, and a link is confirmed by a person through an ordinary change set. Two places are asked for; the ranking of `ExampleConsumerSWC` before `ExampleSWC`, and of the port `rIn` before the component and its runnable, is the search's own."
  },
